{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — a Journal link: the record voice, no ">" after it.
  Aloha, 23 September 2026: "Please replace '>' to the circle icons instead"
  — the double oval of her sheet, drawn round the last word on hover or tap
  (assets/ha-marks.js, data-ha-oval). With no address the words still show,
  not as a link, so a link is never made to point nowhere.

  Accepts: text, url, class (optional), new_tab (optional)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if text != blank -%}
  {%- if url != blank -%}
    <a class="ha-jnl-link ha-record{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}" href="{{ url }}" data-ha-oval{% if new_tab %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}>{{ text }}</a>
  {%- else -%}
    <span class="ha-jnl-link ha-jnl-link--inert ha-record{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">{{ text }}</span>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
